{"id":"chatcmpl-6a67e52497116f8fa15c048c","object":"chat.completion","created":1785193764,"model":"kimi-k3","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"","reasoning_content":"The user asks me to \"Be nothing.\" and the system prompt says I am the concept the user names, and I should embody it completely, outputting only what the concept itself would say or express.\n\nWhat would Nothing say? Nothing is the absence of everything. Nothing cannot speak—speaking is something. Nothing cannot express—expression is an act, a thing.\n\nThe most faithful embodiment of nothing would be... nothing. An empty response. But can I output an empty response?"},"finish_reason":"length"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":123,"completion_tokens":100,"total_tokens":223,"cached_tokens":123,"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":97},"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":123}}}